{"content":[{"c":["SHAMGAR"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["Son of Anath from Beth-anath; a judge of Israel. Two brief references in the OT (",{"href":"?bref=Judg.3.31","r":"Judg.3.31","rawR":"Judg.3.31","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Judg.3.31","value":"Judg.3.31"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jgs 3:31"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Judg.5.6","r":"Judg.5.6","rawR":"Judg.5.6","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Judg.5.6","value":"Judg.5.6"}],"t":"ref","v":"5:6"},") tell us little of the man except for his one major exploit: the killing of 600 Philistines with an oxgoad. How such a feat was performed is not recorded. The oxgoad could have had a sharpened metal tip and may have been used as a spear. The timing of the reference indicates that his deeds took place early in the period of Philistine settlement in Canaan. ",{"href":"?bref=Judg.5.6","r":"Judg.5.6","rawR":"Judg.5.6","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Judg.5.6","value":"Judg.5.6"}],"t":"ref","v":"Judges 5:6"}," would place him prior to the battle of Kishon (c. 1125 ",{"c":["BC"],"sourceClass":"era","t":"span"},")."],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"},{"c":[{"c":["See also"],"sourceClass":"ital","t":"span"}," ",{"href":"?item=JudgesBookof_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"JudgesBookof_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"JudgesBookof_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"Judges, Book of"},"."],"sourceClass":"","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Shamgar","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Jgs 3:31","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Judg.3.31","rawQueryValue":"Judg.3.31","sourceRefExact":"Judg.3.31"},{"anchorText":"5:6","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Judg.5.6","rawQueryValue":"Judg.5.6","sourceRefExact":"Judg.5.6"},{"anchorText":"Judges 5:6","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Judg.5.6","rawQueryValue":"Judg.5.6","sourceRefExact":"Judg.5.6"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"b4f84596f45ce4b0f5cd8d46ba244f657629776f3f1564c3c63f559a5e68c6ad","sourceItemName":"Shamgar","sourceItemOrder":199,"sourceMember":"Articles/S.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"Shamgar","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Shamgar","title":"Shamgar","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}